20	/// integration test (AGENTS.md's "Running and verifying" TODO), so the
21	/// native secure-storage channel is faked with an in-memory store here —
22	/// the test still exercises the *real* `FlutterSecureStorage` instance
23	/// resolved from the single DI container, round-tripping a write/read
24	/// through it exactly as AC4 requires.
